VALUES ('Sonic The Hedgehog', 'After Yasuhara joined Naka and Ohshima, their focus shifted to the protagonist, who Sega hoped could become its mascot. The protagonist was initially a rabbit able to grasp objects with prehensile ears, but the concept proved too complex for the hardware. The team moved on to animals that could roll into a ball, and eventually settled on Sonic, a teal hedgehog created by Ohshima. Naka''s', TO_VECTOR(TO_CLOB('[-0.04283389, -0.00086230, 0.04585361, -0.04679267, -0.07312548, -0.05723943, 0.05871277, 0.00570987, 0.01522102, 0.04628463, 0.07856477, -0.03436107, -0.02931408, 0.06671661, 0.05898763, 0.04375751, 0.09462844, 0.03781057, -0.02197720, -0.05166924, 0.03752065, 0.00298123, 0.04463305, -0.00763951, -0.07968929, 0.01203270, 0.03401138, 0.01142885, -0.04001020, -0.09187272, -0.04017524, -0.00687659, -0.00848006, -0.00958822, -0.03178871, 0.01354514, 0.08676060, 0.02769821, 0.01750233, -0.02766500, -0.07805602, -0.01516583, 0.01119205, 0.02331644, 0.01061580, -0.12032128, -0.08411726, -0.07223947, 0.03952020, 0.06353500, -0.09384499, -0.08279871, 0.02830139, -0.04452189, 0.08442629, 0.04168174, 0.02180797, 0.01235529, 0.09819829, 0.01856011, -0.02106366, -0.05828871, 0.09057092, 0.00796126, 0.05388558, -0.11717163, -0.05298537, 0.03853909, 0.00039676, 0.01590854, 0.00497082, -0.05939304, 0.03241029, -0.00570013, -0.02814217, -0.01371165, -0.03442987, 0.06614576, 0.01524294, 0.03686806, 0.03634140, -0.02127365, -0.04816962, 0.07288578, 0.01674944, 0.08892589, -0.00422320, -0.04059466, -0.04890171, -0.01703622, -0.00411868, -0.03987195, 0.03304889, 0.01965341, 0.03751732, -0.10787200, -0.04449777, 0.01249043, -0.00154723, 0.04552101, 0.01204951, -0.06829221, 0.07529318, -0.05294836, 0.04047959, -0.03587387, -0.05802957, -0.02673831, 0.00397302, -0.01376093, -0.04585030, -0.07028538, -0.05192661, 0.13854244, 0.03185724, -0.01848445, -0.06607620, 0.03268709, -0.06228350, -0.02655371, 0.11895779, 0.00054341, -0.00376307, 0.01786814, -0.0557