VALUES ('Sonic The Hedgehog', 'With its Sonic Jam experiments, Sonic Team began developing a 3D Sonic platformer for the Saturn. The project stemmed from a proposal by Iizuka to develop a Sonic role-playing video game (RPG) with an emphasis on storytelling. Development moved to Sega''s new console, the Dreamcast, which Naka believed would allow for the ultimate Sonic game. Sonic Adventure, directed by Iizuka and relea', TO_VECTOR(TO_CLOB('[-0.00695246, -0.05555175, 0.08187222, -0.07141771, -0.03237199, -0.00185968, -0.01050468, 0.01487972, 0.01538163, 0.05563152, -0.01742378, 0.01043139, -0.01702603, -0.00329128, 0.00581025, 0.01599885, 0.06334455, 0.01359122, 0.07836281, -0.03069410, 0.08469528, -0.02341815, 0.00902144, -0.05444871, -0.02140281, 0.08117377, 0.01838890, -0.05904850, 0.00591569, 0.04553297, 0.03477381, -0.01143876, 0.05148780, -0.02751886, 0.00721519, -0.06876680, 0.01205576, -0.02540272, -0.06931939, -0.01930691, -0.13817467, 0.05622731, -0.02018079, -0.00656753, -0.00689289, -0.09525637, -0.04179394, -0.10751519, 0.00219523, 0.07753133, -0.07877519, -0.07482670, 0.04975189, -0.09145596, 0.03844741, 0.13819055, -0.04656605, 0.00540618, 0.11383037, -0.04912490, -0.02942927, -0.07875323, 0.06704821, -0.00754076, 0.06570753, -0.06580541, -0.00148749, 0.06584933, 0.00913938, -0.08705868, -0.06061070, -0.01593631, 0.00334514, 0.02498421, 0.02546714, 0.04584073, 0.01691047, 0.03916566, -0.07382746, 0.04406609, 0.08826249, -0.07839402, -0.09105528, 0.01052821, 0.03026204, 0.09510827, -0.02327343, -0.02848047, -0.01174220, 0.05565051, -0.05960747, -0.03462327, 0.09706435, -0.01963245, 0.00725329, -0.10146962, 0.00626439, -0.02675389, 0.12317275, 0.02132590, 0.00685794, -0.08402310, 0.05341710, -0.05421657, 0.01906804, 0.00164511, -0.01440240, -0.01342120, 0.00305703, 0.02838513, -0.03374878, -0.05870160, -0.00054194, 0.00925605, 0.09829522, 0.01172919, -0.05985391, 0.03070071, 0.00627723, 0.02220777, 0.10141755, -0.04187809, 0.01517776, 0.00057736, -0.03503